          "htmlContent": "",
          "markdownContent": "### Governance & Decision Chain\n\nThe decision path already emitted as domain metrics and mirrored to OTel (**SPEC-065 R-2**): gateway policy decisions and token verification, execution handoffs / completions / rejections, evidence writes and truncations, audit emits, incident triage, and delegation exchanges \u2014 each broken down by its bounded `result` / `decision` / `reason` / `status` label.\n\n**Requires `OTEL_ENABLED=true`.**"
